 1→//! Scribe - CRDT document sync actor with Loro
 2→//!
 3→//! This crate provides the complete Scribe actor for CRDT document synchronization:
 4→//!
 5→//! ## Core Components
 6→//!
 7→//! - **Scribe actor**: Message-driven actor (via ractor) that owns LoroDoc layers
 8→//! - **ScribeMessage**: All messages the actor can handle
 9→//! - **ScribeState**: Actor state including layers, subscribers, storage
10→//! - **Storage traits**: LayerStorage, PeerVectorStorage, PeerResolver
11→//!
12→//! ## Shared Types
13→//!
14→//! - Message types (BroadcastPayload, PageUpdate, LoroDelta, etc.)
15→//! - ValidationHandle for delegating validation to kunki
16→//! - JsonOp (re-exported from domains for ops extraction)
17→//!
18→//! ## Design
19→//!
20→//! Scribe is storage-agnostic via trait injection:
21→//! - Butler implements LayerStorage, PeerVectorStorage, PeerResolver
22→//! - Scribe only knows about the abstract interface
23→//! - This allows testing with mock implementations
24→
